   "locked": false,
   "text": "Reading the picture: the extension itself is lost in the noise (A, B, C, E, F are all within a few percent of one core).\nPlay mode (D) is the one expensive feature: a JavaScript timer moves widgets 30 times a second.\nMemory is not shown: with versus without the extension differs by less than the run to run noise of about 10 MB.\nEvery bar comes from scripts/measure.py, which you can run yourself. Percentages are indicative within about 2 points.",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "baseline": 14,
   "containerId": "n1",
   "originalText": "Reading the picture: the extension itself is lost in the noise (A, B, C, E, F are all within a few percent of one core).\nPlay mode (D) is the one expensive feature: a JavaScript timer moves widgets 30 times a second.\nMemory is not shown: with versus without the extension differs by less than the run to run noise of about 10 MB.\nEvery bar comes from scripts/measure.py, which you can run yourself. Percentages are indicative within about 2 points.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  }
 ],
